Brothers perform dawn rites at Mandākinī --- Bharata returns the kingdom to Rāma --- Bharata pleads inability through beast and tree parables --- Citizens applaud Bharata's plea --- Rāma preaches universal impermanence and death --- Rāma recalls Daśaratha's sacrifices and heaven --- Rāma bids Bharata rule Ayodhyā as commanded --- Bharata praises Rāma and begs pardon for Kaikeyī --- Bharata offers crowning here or forest exile together --- Rāma stays firm as priests and mothers join the plea